          "label": "Text",
          "raw_label": "Text",
          "reading_order": 6,
          "html": "<p>at different doses and routes, started between 36 h and 6 months after onset, assessed with different primary outcome instruments over 14 days to 24 months. Two trials reporting a binary functional outcome at approximately 3 months do so at different thresholds, mRS 0 to 1 and mRS 0 to 2, which are related but not interchangeable. We note explicitly that seven of the nine trials</p>",
